"gitch saves a backup before pull, up, sync, fix, undo and amend, and keeps the 30 most recent." = "gitch zapisuje kopię przed pull, up, sync, fix, undo i amend i przechowuje 30 najnowszych.";
"gitch sets the commit author to %@ and points origin (and upstream) at %@'s SSH alias, then locks the repository to it." = "gitch ustawia autora commitów na %1$@, kieruje origin (i upstream) na alias SSH konta %2$@, a potem blokuje repozytorium na tym koncie.";
